---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Signup from '../components/Signup.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About"
  description="Why CommunitySolarPA exists: helping Pennsylvania adopt solar for a cleaner future, lasting energy independence, and access for every household."
>
  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <div class="eyebrow">Our mission</div>
      <h1>Helping Pennsylvania adopt solar, for everyone</h1>
      <p>
        We're working to help Pennsylvania adopt solar energy at scale. We believe community solar
        can deliver three things at once:
      </p>
      <div class="grid" style="margin:1.5em 0">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>A cleaner future</h3>
          <p>Power from the sun instead of burning fossil fuels.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Lasting energy independence</h3>
          <p>Energy produced here in Pennsylvania, from a source that never runs out.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Solar for everyone</h3>
          <p>Renters, apartment dwellers, and households on every budget can benefit, not just homeowners with a sunny roof.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Explain community solar</strong> in plain language, so Pennsylvanians know what it is and how it works.</li>
        <li><strong>Track Pennsylvania's progress</strong> on the legislation and rules that would make it possible.</li>
        <li><strong>Keep people informed</strong> when there's news and when community solar becomes available in their area.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Get in touch</h2>
      <p>
        Questions, ideas, or want to help? Email us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@communitysolarpa.org">hello@communitysolarpa.org</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Signup />
</Base>
